(function(g){function e(s){return String(s||"").replace(/&/g,"&amp;").replace(/</g,"&lt;").replace(/>/g,"&gt;")}function p(src){var s=e(src);s=s.replace(/```([^\n]*)\n([\s\S]*?)```/g,"<pre><code>$2</code></pre>");s=s.replace(/(^\|.+\|\n)(?:\|\s*:?-+:?\s*)+\|\n((?:\|.*\|\n?)+)/gm,function(_,head,body){var h=head.trim().slice(1,-1).split("|").map(function(x){return "<th>"+x.trim()+"</th>"}).join("");var rows=body.trim().split("\n").map(function(r){return "<tr>"+r.trim().slice(1,-1).split("|").map(function(x){return "<td>"+x.trim()+"</td>"}).join("")+"</tr>"}).join("");return "<table><thead><tr>"+h+"</tr></thead><tbody>"+rows+"</tbody></table>"});s=s.replace(/^### (.+)$/gm,"<h3>$1</h3>").replace(/^## (.+)$/gm,"<h2>$1</h2>").replace(/^# (.+)$/gm,"<h1>$1</h1>");s=s.replace(/\*\*(.+?)\*\*/g,"<strong>$1</strong>").replace(/`([^`]+)`/g,"<code>$1</code>");s=s.replace(/^(?:- .+(?:\n|$))+/gm,function(b){return "<ul>"+b.trim().split("\n").map(function(x){return "<li>"+x.slice(2)+"</li>"}).join("")+"</ul>"});return s.split(/\n{2,}/).map(function(b){return /^<(h\d|pre|ul|table)/.test(b)?b:"<p>"+b.replace(/\n/g,"<br>")+"</p>"}).join("")}g.marked={parse:p}})(window);
